msgstr "Peranti, pertanyaan datanya dan graf gambaran keseluruhannya telah dicipta."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Peranti tidak lagi dipetakan. Ia dan grafnya dikekalkan; pertanyaan datanya tidak menyenaraikan sasaran sehingga ia dipetakan semula."

